        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Laurey Kama Flower Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Flower Cabinet Knob is a southwest kitchen hardware dream come true. The Laurey Kama Flower Cabinet Knob is affordable, beautiful, and stylish. Choose from a few eye-catching finish colors. The 1-1/2 inch Kama Flower Knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware making it easy to install in your Western Styled Kitchen or as a rustic drawer knob on furniture. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-234-Side.jpg?v=1704354768\" width=\"100\" height=\"94\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Laurey 234 Side View\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Kama\">Laurey Kama Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 1-1/2\" Flower Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
